[22.883895, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Session: session-20261112-105835-595-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Permissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mTip: Run \u001b[1mami --skill <name>\u001b[22m to pin a skill stance for the session.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > In the current directory only, with no network access, build a small Python command-line units \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mconverter split across separate files (for example, conversion logic, formatting, and CLI entry \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mpoint), then run it end to end with sample inputs and print a concise, readable conversion summary \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mto the terminal\u2014do not use absolute paths, /tmp, or long real-time animations. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan list_dir(Contents of /tmp/ami-demo-Qgjhgb: (1 entries)) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan glob([2 files]) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI\u2019ll build three focused modules: conversion rules and validation, output formatting, and the CLI\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kentry point. Then I\u2019ll run syntax checks plus several end-to-end examples using relative paths only.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m[Checkpoint cp-1794481134536-1: /tmp/ami-demo-Qgjhgb/units_conversion.py]\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K  \u001b[38;5;167m\u25